>10.1002/jcp.20385</pub-id>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15895410</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib44"><citation citation-type="journal">van der Rest, M., and R. Garrone. <year>1991</year>. Collagen family of proteins. <source>FASEB J.</source> <volume>5</volume>:<fpage>2814</fpage>&#x02013;2823.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1916105</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib45"><citation citation-type="journal">Werb, Z., T.H. Vu, J.L. Rinkenberger, and L.M. Coussens. <year>1999</year>. Matrix-degrading proteases and angiogenesis during development and tumor formation. <source>APMIS.</source> <volume>107</volume>:<fpage>11</fpage>&#x02013;18.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10190275</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>